              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "nóngcūn — \"the countryside; a farming village\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "wǒ lǎojiā zài nóngcūn — My home town is out in the countryside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its characters come later; for now it is a word for the ear."
